WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.800
You: Hey Ava.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:08.100
You: Give me one short idea for a five-minute break.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.700
Ava: Make a cup of tea and stretch.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.800
You: And one that I can do sitting down?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.700
Ava: Listen to a favourite song with your eyes closed.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.400
You: That’s all.
